cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CENSO or this pipeline, please cite the paper."
title: "CENSO: an ontology for censored environmental measurements"
abstract: >-
  CENSO binds the quantification limit to the analytical run rather than to the
  instrument, so a non-detection can be represented as the interval it actually
  establishes, and compliance becomes four-valued rather than two-valued.
  Ships with pluggable, versioned regulation packages for Türkiye and the EU.
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://w3id.org/censo/"
version: "2.0.0"
